hyperium/h2 (MIT)
-----------------

Upstream: https://github.com/hyperium/h2

The HPACK implementation and the frame codec were taken from h2 and adapted.
The files concerned:

    src/hpack/                  header compression: decoder, encoder,
                                dynamic table, Huffman coding and its
                                generated table
    src/codec/                  frame parsing and serialization, frame
                                types, stream ids

Changes made against upstream: `Bytes` removed from several paths so header
and frame data can be read out of the buffers this crate's runtime owns,
unused frame types and code paths dropped, HEADERS frame handling reworked,
and upstream's own test fixtures and fuzz targets removed.

Everything else in this repository is original work: the connection and
stream state machines (`src/protocol/`), the write path and its buffer pool
(`src/io/`), the server and client entry points, the gRPC framing
(`src/grpc/`), and the test suites (`tests/`).

